{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"機場停機坪穿梭巴士疑急煞　五人受輕傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-AIRPORT-261111-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】機場停機坪穿梭巴士疑急煞，乘客跌倒，五人受輕傷送院。</p><p>受傷乘客帶同行李由救護車送到北大嶼山醫院，晚上約十時，接載旅客由停機坪到機場客運大樓的穿梭巴士疑急煞，令乘客失平衡跌倒。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.609626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:56.116538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:41.828276+00:00","content_hash":"dc47e531c8a4a72acc5ac1ef9dcd48108a33e49c2b5edb7963f0b11d82adb487","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}